  "subparagraph_mapping": {
    "09.7.187": "JurisLean.Candidates.W6JudgmentCashAudit20261104.four_stage_numeric_and_cash_witness, timed_X_is_actual_cash_projection, and raw_stages_reuse_existing_invariants record the four-stage quantity/cash progression and existing invariant/cash-projection links. The witness keeps judgment truth separate from cash occurrence, uses distinct cash event IDs, and prevents a second amount from copying or double-debiting the original debt under the stated finite inputs.",
    "09.7.189": "four_stage_numeric_and_cash_witness records the bounded judgment/payment accounting and state distinction; no numeric result itself establishes a real payment or external legal effect.",
    "09.7.191-196": "toyWorlds_satisfy_one_Theta and toyWorlds_share_same_observed_W6 give three finite worlds under one explicit Theta and the same W6 observation; Bp_does_not_semantically_entail_Bn, Bn_does_not_semantically_entail_E, and E_does_not_semantically_entail_X provide the three non-entailment witnesses. X is the stipulated secondId actual-cash projection in this toy model.",
    "09.7.198": "The finite witness separates the original debt quantity from judgment state and recorded cash; conclusions are conditional on the stated model inputs and do not derive arbitrary-layer compatibility.",
    "09.7.200": "conditional_rJ_branch_is_separate_and_source_bound proves the conditional rJ record uses its source-bound identity and distinct judgment relation. This only supports the listed duplicate-relief/Theta constraints; it does not invent or certify any additional Theta rule."
  },
